The verifier was extracted and modified from the candidate-v2 remediation work
for the author's DeepSeek Prover V2 / TMI Lean project. This distribution
repackages the trusted Lean inspector and Python pipeline with a standalone CLI,
regression harness, process cleanup, documentation and explicit release limits.

Lean is an external dependency, not redistributed here.
Optional MLX libraries and model weights have their own licenses.
No model weights, chat archives, author images or working adapters are included.
